\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\lang1040\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. O Thou who camest from above
\par The pure celestial power to impart,
\par Kindle a flame of sacred love
\par On the mean altar of my heart!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. There let it for Thy glory burn
\par With inextinguishable blaze;
\par And trembling to its source return,
\par In humble prayer and fervent praise.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Jesus, confirm my heart's desire
\par To work, and speak, and think for Thee;
\par Still let me guard the holy fire,
\par And still stir up Thy gift in me.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Ready for all Thy perfect will,
\par My acts of faith and love repeat,
\par Till death Thy endless mercies seal,
\par And make the sacrifice complete. 
\par                                    Amen.
\par \lang1033\f1 
\par \cf1\lang1040\ul\b\f2\fs16 
\par }

